---
---

<section class="w-full bg-[#FBFAF7] border-t border-[#E4DED3] py-20 lg:py-24" id="pillars">
  <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-6 md:px-10 lg:px-16">
    <div class="reveal-item flex flex-col gap-3 md:flex-row md:items-baseline md:justify-between mb-10 pb-4 border-b border-[#E4DED3]">
      <h2 class="text-sm uppercase tracking-widest font-bold text-[#77592A]">
        Core Scrutiny Pillars // Property Assurance
      </h2>
      <span class="text-sm text-[#5C6370]">
        Thorough advocate-led examination protocols
      </span>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 lg:gap-8">
      <div class="reveal-item stagger-1 p-6 lg:p-7 bg-white border border-[#E4DED3] rounded-2xl space-y-3 transition-colors hover:border-[#C9B483]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#A98A50]"></span>
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#77592A] uppercase tracking-wider">01 / Origin</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#181c24]">Genesis &amp; Root Title</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-[#45474b] leading-relaxed">
          Exhaustive root examination through historical Pahanis, record of rights (ROR), mutation ledgers, and original sovereign grants.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal-item stagger-2 p-6 lg:p-7 bg-white border border-[#E4DED3] rounded-2xl space-y-3 transition-colors hover:border-[#C9B483]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#A98A50]"></span>
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#77592A] uppercase tracking-wider">02 / Regulatory</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#181c24]">Prohibited &amp; 22-A Scrutiny</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-[#45474b] leading-relaxed">
          Screening against Section 22-A prohibited registers, government assigned lands, Wakf/Endowment listings, and master plan zoning buffers.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal-item stagger-3 p-6 lg:p-7 bg-white border border-[#E4DED3] rounded-2xl space-y-3 transition-colors hover:border-[#C9B483]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#A98A50]"></span>
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#77592A] uppercase tracking-wider">03 / Judicial</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#181c24]">Litigation &amp; Court Searches</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-[#45474b] leading-relaxed">
          In-depth docket searches across civil jurisdictions, high courts, and revenue appellate authorities for adverse claims and lis pendens.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal-item stagger-4 p-6 lg:p-7 bg-white border border-[#E4DED3] rounded-2xl space-y-3 transition-colors hover:border-[#C9B483]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#A98A50]"></span>
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#77592A] uppercase tracking-wider">04 / Evidentiary</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#181c24]">Reasoned Written Opinion</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-[#45474b] leading-relaxed">
          Definitive legal certification, detailed defect remediation roadmaps, and actionable risk matrices under advocate signature.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
